abstract: >-
  My single-process AI agent platform. One Python process: FastAPI backend, React 19 console, streaming chat, single + multi-agent teams, RAG, memory, a code sandbox, 19 LLM providers, 30+ tools, 4 enterprise presets. I built it because every AI demo I saw needed four containers and half a day of YAML to boot.
